projects.csv, organisations.csv, participations.csv and schemes.csv in this
folder are derived from project.csv, organization.csv, topics.csv and
legalBasis.csv in CORDIS's export of 2026-08-06 (cordis-HORIZONprojects-csv.zip,
as the Internet Archive captured it on 2026-08-19). Changes: columns selected
(project objectives, keywords, addresses, contacts and CORDIS bookkeeping
dropped), organisations listed once each, positions split into latitude and
longitude, amounts written with a decimal point, and the CSV dialect
normalised. They are not committed: infra/dev/examples/cordis/fetch.sh derives
them, and it is the full description of how.
